2.34.1

Samsung Galaxy A52/A72 are devices released on atoll (SM7125) platform
in 2021. Add initial device tree for SM7125 Samsung platform with
support for:
- Framebuffer
- GPIO keys
- Hall sensor
- Vibrator
- Regulators
- Reset input
- Real-time clock
- SD card
- UFS
- USB

